\f0\b \cf0 We added the statement of replication to the Materials & Methods.\
The statistical tests are:\
- individual flash sequences, abstracted to a wavelet to determine whether there is a significant 4 step periodicity\
-use of the wavelet for each flash sequence to determine a damping index of flash count when the 4-step periodicity of the wavelet damps out due to randomization of the PSII population S-States.
\f1\b0 \

\f0\b -Generalized additive modelling of damping index across conditions for each strain;  in cases where replicate measures were done for a strain, these replicates were included in the input to the GAM, but the GAM does not require replication of individual measurements to generate a response surface for the damping index variable.\
-ANOVA of the damping index responses across ranges of flash spacing (~ measurement light), measurement temperature, and salinity.  
