\f0\b We added a statement that the minimum 30 s dark relaxation was not systematically evaluated across all taxa and measurement conditions; duration of dark incubation might  be a factor; but pilot trials showed no effects of longer dark incubations, and we faced operational limits on the total duration of measurements.\

