\f0\b We revised the GAM contour  figures to now only include those fitted values where the standard error of the mean was < 100% of the fitted value.\
The 320% plots were a mistake; we varied the %SEM thresholds for inclusion of fitted values in plots up and down, to see if that affected conclusions;  it did not.\
So we reverted to a more reasonable inclusion of fitted points with narrower SEM. \
This results in bigger 'blank' areas on some plots but does not alter conclusions.
